url: "https://github.com/wenareeba/outcome-harvesting"
abstract: >-
  A free, page-cited library for Outcome Harvesting, an evaluation approach that
  starts from the changes that have happened and works back to how an
  intervention contributed to them: an eight-lesson interactive course with
  reference cards, a verified annotated bibliography with BibTeX and an errata
  page, five templates, and a red team protocol for checking that a harvest was
  done properly.
keywords:
  - outcome harvesting
  - monitoring and evaluation
